  8: "I'm not writing from the top of the mountain looking down. I'm sitting in the middle of the journey, with the same old laptop, doing exactly what I'm about to describe on every page.",
  9: "This journey started with a name I'll never forget: Sơn Piaz.",
  10: "He wandered all over America — not as a tourist, but to find one answer: how can an ordinary person become truly free on the internet?",
  11: "I was lucky enough to walk part of that road with him.",
  12: "From the real conversations, from sitting there watching him build a system from zero, from his willingness to go and to try — that's where I understood what I'd been missing.",
  13: "That's where <b>START 01</b> came from.",
