  21: "— Phong Menly",
  22: "A Note About This Book",
  23: "This is the first manuscript in the <b>START 01</b> series, put together from my own real journey through affiliate marketing.",
  24: "Every story in this book is a <b>true story</b>, retold in a natural, close-up voice so the lessons come out of real life instead of theory.",
  25: "<b>Author:</b> Phong Menly. <b>Produced:</b> with the help of my “Second Brain” system and artificial intelligence. <b>Images and design:</b> created with AI.",
  26: "Opening Words",
  27: "At twenty, I made a vow.",
  28: "“Either I succeed, or I die on the way to succeeding.”",
  29: "I meant it. My mouth, my chest full of fire — I believed every word. My friends stood and watched me walk ahead. Back then I thought that was what made me different.",
  30: "Then ten years passed. I looked back and started doubting myself. My shoulders ached. I kept pushing and never found the way out. I drifted into the fog — and fell into somebody else's game.",
  31: "Then came a family. The wild horse was slowly covered over by time and responsibility. A few more years of letting go. And just like that, I forgot my own dream.",
